[
  {
    "text": "每次出差旅行",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 1.22,
    "duration": 1.22
  },
  {
    "text": "是不是都在为带哪个吹风机发愁",
    "start_time": 1.22,
    "end_time": 4.068,
    "duration": 2.847
  },
  {
    "text": "酒店的吹风机",
    "start_time": 4.068,
    "end_time": 5.288,
    "duration": 1.22
  },
  {
    "text": "风小还伤发",
    "start_time": 5.288,
    "end_time": 6.305,
    "duration": 1.017
  },
  {
    "text": "我真的会谢",
    "start_time": 6.305,
    "end_time": 7.322,
    "duration": 1.017
  },
  {
    "text": "还好被我挖到了这个出差神器",
    "start_time": 7.322,
    "end_time": 9.966,
    "duration": 2.644
  },
  {
    "text": "它折起来就比手机大一点点",
    "start_time": 9.966,
    "end_time": 12.406,
    "duration": 2.441
  },
  {
    "text": "放包里",
    "start_time": 12.406,
    "end_time": 13.017,
    "duration": 0.61
  },
  {
    "text": "行李箱里巨省地方",
    "start_time": 13.017,
    "end_time": 14.644,
    "duration": 1.627
  },
  {
    "text": "别看它小",
    "start_time": 14.644,
    "end_time": 15.457,
    "duration": 0.814
  },
  {
    "text": "11万转的风力可不是盖的",
    "start_time": 15.457,
    "end_time": 17.898,
    "duration": 2.441
  },
  {
    "text": "我这长头发",
    "start_time": 17.898,
    "end_time": 18.915,
    "duration": 1.017
  },
  {
    "text": "几分钟就搞定了",
    "start_time": 18.915,
    "end_time": 20.338,
    "duration": 1.424
  },
  {
    "text": "而且它这个屏显调温我真的超爱",
    "start_time": 20.338,
    "end_time": 23.186,
    "duration": 2.847
  },
  {
    "text": "想要什么温度自己调",
    "start_time": 23.186,
    "end_time": 25.016,
    "duration": 1.83
  },
  {
    "text": "清清楚楚",
    "start_time": 25.016,
    "end_time": 25.83,
    "duration": 0.814
  },
  {
    "text": "经常出门的姐妹",
    "start_time": 25.83,
    "end_time": 27.254,
    "duration": 1.424
  },
  {
    "text": "这个颜值高又强悍的小东西",
    "start_time": 27.254,
    "end_time": 29.694,
    "duration": 2.441
  },
  {
    "text": "必须焊在你的行李箱里",
    "start_time": 29.694,
    "end_time": 31.728,
    "duration": 2.034
  }
]